      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Welcome to Truthward.",
          "start": 3.0,
          "dur": 1.862,
          "abs_start": 3.0
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Good to have you here.",
          "start": 4.862,
          "dur": 1.862,
          "abs_start": 4.862
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Here is the whole idea behind this channel.",
          "start": 6.724,
          "dur": 3.756,
          "abs_start": 6.724
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "In every video, we take one real question, and we do our honest best to answer it.",
          "start": 10.98,
          "dur": 5.93,
          "abs_start": 10.98
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "We reason it through, step by step, and we look at it honestly, without preaching and without telling you what to think.",
          "start": 16.91,
          "dur": 7.49,
          "abs_start": 16.91
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "And by the end, we will usually have more than an answer.",
          "start": 24.9,
          "dur": 3.58,
          "abs_start": 24.9
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "We will have a new question or two worth chasing, and those become the next videos.",
          "start": 28.48,
          "dur": 4.665,
          "abs_start": 28.48
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "That is really all this is.",
          "start": 33.146,
          "dur": 1.714,
          "abs_start": 33.146
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "Because the truth is never as complicated as people make it sound.",
          "start": 35.36,
          "dur": 3.983,
          "abs_start": 35.36
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "It is honest, and simple enough for anyone to follow.",
          "start": 39.343,
          "dur": 3.449,
          "abs_start": 39.343
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "So all we try to do here is bring it back to the surface, one question at a time.",
          "start": 42.793,
          "dur": 5.007,
          "abs_start": 42.793
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "If you want to come along for that, subscribe so the next question finds you.",
          "start": 48.3,
          "dur": 4.865,
          "abs_start": 48.3
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "Leave a comment, especially if you see it differently.",
          "start": 53.165,
          "dur": 4.366,
          "abs_start": 53.165
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "And if it was worth your time, a like helps.",
          "start": 57.531,
          "dur": 2.869,
          "abs_start": 57.531
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "Alright.",
          "start": 60.9,
          "dur": 0.74,
          "abs_start": 60.9
        },
        {
          "i": 15,
          "text": "Let us begin.",
          "start": 61.64,
          "dur": 1.25,
          "abs_start": 61.64
        }
      ],
